SUMMARY:Atheist chat Sunday 11/15
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Atheists\nPlease come visit with us this Sunday Nove
 mber 15 to chat with like-minded people. Our new location is really workin
 g out well. It's sunny and quieter than our previous spot.\nWe're meeting 
 once a month on Sunday mornings. Watch your email for a specific date each
  month.\nIf you think you might come\, please mark Attend below\; that hel
 ps us know how many tables to put together. But many have come without mar
 king that\, and that's fine.\nOur great new location is the cafe upstairs 
 at Whole Foods\, 4 South Tunnel Road (across from the mall). They have cof
 fee and a lot more. Maybe you have shopping you want to do at Whole Foods 
 or one of the other businesses on Tunnel Road before or after the meeting.
 \nWe start at 10am and end at noon\, but you're welcome to arrive or leave
  according to your own schedule.\nBTW - did you know our group now has ove
 r 150 members? We'd like to see more than 15-20 at a meeting\, so please c
 ome by and get to know your fellow atheists.
